  "description": "Yun-Seul’s life has been ruined by her ties to a criminal organization. She succeeds in kidnapping Seong Jae-Ha, the daughter of a powerful boss. The two engage in a psychological battle, each treating the other as a lowlife, and after a physical struggle, Yoon-Seul subdues Jae-Ha with a stun gun. Yoon-Seul uses a body search as an excuse to strip Jae-Ha of her clothes, successfully humiliating her, but…\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
